    "title": "<p>Differential diagnosis of diffuse variants of primary cutaneous follicle centre lymphomas (PCFCLs) rich in large/spindled cells versus primary cutaneous diffuse large B-cell lymphoma, leg type (PCLBCL-LT)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Oschlies I, Willemze R, Vergier B",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 189.7pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"253\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Feature</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">PCFCL diffuse large cell&nbsp;/ spindle cell variants</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 263.85pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"352\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">PCLBCL-LT</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid; mso-row-margin-right: .3pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"5\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Histopathology</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"mso-cell-special: placeholder; border: none; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" width=\"0\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 161.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"215\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Morphology of tumour cells </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">++</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Predominance of large centrocytes including multilobated and spindle cells; centroblasts may be present, but not in confluent sheets</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 263.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"352\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">++</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Predominance or confluent sheets of round centroblasts and/or immunoblasts, rare blastoid cells</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 161.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"215\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>High proliferative rate</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+, in diffuse PCFCL ++</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 263.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"352\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">++</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 161.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"215\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Diffuse growth</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&minus;/+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 263.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"352\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">++</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 161.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"215\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Follicular growth</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+/&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 263.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"352\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus; (nodules possible)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 161.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"215\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Reactive T&nbsp;cells</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">++</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 263.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"352\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid; mso-row-margin-right: .3pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 680.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"907\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Immunophenotype</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"mso-cell-special: placeholder; border: none; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" width=\"0\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 133.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">IRF4&nbsp;(MUM1)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&minus;/+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 263.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"352\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">++<sup>a</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 133.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">BCL2</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;/+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 263.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"352\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">++<sup>a</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 133.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">IgM</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&minus;</span></p>\r\